#. Introduction text of the request-data Web Form
#: frappe/website/web_form/request_data/request_data.json:17
msgid "<div class=\"ql-editor read-mode\"><p>Request a file containing your personally identifiable information (PII) that is saved on our system. The file will be in JSON format and is sent to you by email. If you would like to have your PII deleted from our system, please make a <a href=\"/request-to-delete-data\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">request to delete data</a>.</p></div>"
msgstr "<div class=\"ql-editor read-mode\"><p>Манай систем дээр хадгалагдсан таны хувийн мэдээллийг (PII) агуулсан файл хүсэх. Файл нь JSON форматаар байх бөгөөд танд имэйлээр илгээгдэх болно. Хэрэв та манай системээс PII-гээ устгахыг хүсвэл <a href=\"/request-to-delete-data\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">өгөгдлийг устгах хүсэлт гаргана уу</a>.</p></div>"

#. Introduction text of the request-to-delete-data Web Form
#: frappe/website/web_form/request_to_delete_data/request_to_delete_data.json:18
msgid "<div class=\"ql-editor read-mode\"><p>Send a request to delete your account and personally identifiable information (PII) that is stored on our system. You will receive an email to verify your request. Once the request is verified we will take care of deleting your PII. If you just want to check what PII we have stored, you can <a href=\"/request-data\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">request your data</a>.</p></div>"
msgstr "<div class=\"ql-editor read-mode\"><p>Манай системд хадгалагдсан бүртгэл болон хувийн мэдээллийг (PII) устгах хүсэлт илгээнэ үү. Та хүсэлтээ баталгаажуулах имэйл хүлээн авах болно. Хүсэлтийг баталгаажуулсны дараа бид таны PII-г устгах болно. Хэрэв та зөвхөн бидний хадгалсан PII-г шалгахыг хүсвэл <a href=\"/request-data\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">өөрийн өгөгдлийг хүсэх боломжтой</a>.</p></div>"

#. Content of the 'Help HTML' (HTML) field in DocType 'Document Naming
#. Settings'
#: frappe/core/doctype/document_naming_settings/document_naming_settings.json:40
#, python-brace-format
msgid "<div class=\"well\">\n"
"    Edit list of Series in the box. Rules:\n"
"    <ul>\n"
"        <li>Each Series Prefix on a new line.</li>\n"
"        <li>Allowed special characters are \"/\" and \"-\"</li>\n"
"        <li>\n"
"            Optionally, set the number of digits in the series using dot (.)\n"
"            followed by hashes (#). For example, \".####\" means that the series\n"
"            will have four digits. Default is five digits.\n"
"        </li>\n"
"        <li>\n"
"            You can also use variables in the series name by putting them\n"
"            between (.) dots\n"
"            <br>\n"
"            Supported Variables:\n"
"            <ul>\n"
"                <li><code>.YYYY.</code> - Year in 4 digits</li>\n"
"                <li><code>.YY.</code> - Year in 2 digits</li>\n"
"                <li><code>.MM.</code> - Month</li>\n"
"                <li><code>.DD.</code> - Day of month</li>\n"
"                <li><code>.WW.</code> - Week of the year</li>\n"
"                <li><code>.FY.</code> - Fiscal Year</li>\n"
"                <li>\n"
"                    <code>.{fieldname}.</code> - fieldname on the document e.g.\n"
"                    <code>branch</code>\n"
"                </li>\n"
"            </ul>\n"
"        </li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    Examples:\n"
"    <ul>\n"
"        <li>INV-</li>\n"
"        <li>INV-10-</li>\n"
"        <li>INVK-</li>\n"
"        <li>INV-.YYYY.-.{branch}.-.MM.-.####</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<br>\n"
msgstr "<div class=\"well\">\n"
"    Хайрцаг дахь цувралын жагсаалтыг засах. Дүрэм:\n"
"    <ul>\n"
"        <li>Цувралын угтвар бүрийг шинэ мөрөнд оруулна.</li>\n"
"        <li>Зөвшөөрөгдсөн тусгай тэмдэгтүүд нь \"/\" болон \"-\"</li>\n"
"        <li>\n"
"            Эсвэл цэг (.)\n"
"            тэмдэгтийг ашиглан дараа нь хэш (#) тэмдэгтийг ашиглан цувралын цифрүүдийн тоог тохируулна уу. Жишээлбэл, \".####\" нь\n"
"            цуврал нь дөрвөн оронтой байна гэсэн үг юм. Анхдагч утга нь таван оронтой байна.\n"
"        </li>\n"
"        <li>\n"
"            Та мөн цувралын нэрэнд хувьсагчдыг\n"
"            цэгүүдийн хооронд\n"
"            <br>\n"
"            Дэмжигдсэн хувьсагчууд:\n"
"            <ul>\n"
"                <li><code>.YYYY.</code> - Жилийг 4 оронтой тоогоор</li>\n"
"                <li><code>.YY.</code> - Жилийг 2 оронтой тоогоор</li>\n"
"                <li><code>.MM.</code> - Сар</li>\n"
"                <li><code>.ӨӨ.</code> - Сарын өдөр</li>\n"
"                <li><code>.ДХ.</code> - Жилийн долоо хоног</li>\n"
"                <li><code>.FY.</code> - Санхүүгийн жил</li>\n"
"                <li>\n"
"                    <code>.{fieldname}.</code> - баримт бичиг дээрх талбарын нэр жишээ нь\n"
"                    <code>салбар</code>\n"
"                </li>\n"
"            </ul>\n"
"        </li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    Жишээ:\n"
"    <ul>\n"
"        <li>НӨАТ-</li>\n"
"        <li>НӨАТ-10-</li>\n"
"        <li>НӨАТ-</li>\n"
"        <li>ИНВ-.ЖЖЖЖ.-.{branch}.-.СС.-.####</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<br>\n"

#. Content of the 'Custom HTML Help' (HTML) field in DocType 'Print Format'
#: frappe/printing/doctype/print_format/print_format.json:187
#, python-brace-format
msgid "<h3>Custom CSS Help</h3>\n\n"
"<p>Notes:</p>\n\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>All field groups (label + value) are set attributes <code>data-fieldtype</code> and <code>data-fieldname</code></li>\n"
"<li>All values are given class <code>value</code></li>\n"
"<li>All Section Breaks are given class <code>section-break</code></li>\n"
"<li>All Column Breaks are given class <code>column-break</code></li>\n"
"</ol>\n\n"
"<h4>Examples</h4>\n\n"
"<p>1. Left align integers</p>\n\n"
"<pre><code>[data-fieldtype=\"Int\"] .value { text-align: left; }</code></pre>\n\n"
"<p>1. Add border to sections except the last section</p>\n\n"
"<pre><code>.section-break { padding: 30px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }\n"
".section-break:last-child { padding-bottom: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;  }</code></pre>\n"
msgstr "<h3>CSS-ийн тусгай тусламж</h3>\n\n"
"<p>Тэмдэглэл:</p>\n\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>Бүх талбарын бүлгүүд (шошго + утга) нь тохируулсан шинж чанарууд юм <code>data-fieldtype</code> болон <code>data-fieldname</code></li>\n"
"<li>Бүх утгуудад <code>утга</code></li>\n"
"<li>Бүх хэсгийн завсарлагад <code>хэсгийн завсарлага</code></li>ангилал өгөгдсөн\n"
"<li>Бүх баганын завсарлагад <code>багана-завсарлага</code></li>\n"
"</ol>\n\n"
"<h4>Жишээнүүд</h4>\n\n"
"<p>1. Бүхэл тоонуудыг зүүн тийш зэрэгцүүлэх</p>\n\n"
"<pre><code>[data-fieldtype=\"Int\"] .value { text-align: left; } }</code></pre>\n\n"
"<p>1. Сүүлийн хэсгээс бусад хэсгүүдэд хүрээ нэмэх</p>\n\n"
"<pre><code>.section-break { padding: 30px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }\n"
".section-break:last-child { padding-bottom: 0px; border-bottom: 0px; }</code></pre>\n"

#. Content of the 'Print Format Help' (HTML) field in DocType 'Print Format'
#: frappe/printing/doctype/print_format/print_format.json:199
#, python-format
msgid "<h3>Print Format Help</h3>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>Introduction</h4>\n"
"<p>Print Formats are rendered on the server side using the Jinja Templating Language. All forms have access to the <code>doc</code> object which contains information about the document that is being formatted. You can also access common utilities via the <code>frappe</code> module.</p>\n"
"<p>For styling, the Boostrap CSS framework is provided and you can enjoy the full range of classes.</p>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>References</h4>\n"
"<ol>\n"
"\t<li><a href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/\" target=\"_blank\">Jinja Templating Language</a></li>\n"
"\t<li><a href=\"http://getbootstrap.com\" target=\"_blank\">Bootstrap CSS Framework</a></li>\n"
"</ol>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\n"
"<pre><code>&lt;h3&gt;{{ doc.select_print_heading or \"Invoice\" }}&lt;/h3&gt;\n"
"&lt;div class=\"row\"&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-3 text-right\"&gt;Customer Name&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-9\"&gt;{{ doc.customer_name }}&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;div class=\"row\"&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-3 text-right\"&gt;Date&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-9\"&gt;{{ doc.get_formatted(\"invoice_date\") }}&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;table class=\"table table-bordered\"&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;tbody&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Sr&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Item Name&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Description&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Qty&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Rate&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Amount&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t{%- for row in doc.items -%}\n"
"\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 3%;\"&gt;{{ row.idx }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 20%;\"&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t\t{{ row.item_name }}\n"
"\t\t\t\t{% if row.item_code != row.item_name -%}\n"
"\t\t\t\t&lt;br&gt;Item Code: {{ row.item_code}}\n"
"\t\t\t\t{%- endif %}\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 37%;\"&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t\t&lt;div style=\"border: 0px;\"&gt;{{ row.description }}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{ row.qty }} {{ row.uom or row.stock_uom }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 15%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{\n"
"\t\t\t\trow.get_formatted(\"rate\", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 15%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{\n"
"\t\t\t\trow.get_formatted(\"amount\", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t{%- endfor -%}\n"
"\t&lt;/tbody&gt;\n"
"&lt;/table&gt;</code></pre>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>Common Functions</h4>\n"
"<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n"
"\t<tbody>\n"
"\t\t<tr>\n"
"\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><code>doc.get_formatted(\"[fieldname]\", [parent_doc])</code></td>\n"
"\t\t\t<td>Get document value formatted as Date, Currency, etc. Pass parent <code>doc</code> for currency type fields.</td>\n"
"\t\t</tr>\n"
"\t\t<tr>\n"
"\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><code>frappe.db.get_value(\"[doctype]\", \"[name]\", \"fieldname\")</code></td>\n"
"\t\t\t<td>Get value from another document.</td>\n"
"\t\t</tr>\n"
"\t</tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
msgstr "\\<h3>Хэвлэх форматын тусламж\\</h3>\n"
"\\<hr>\n"
"\\<h4>Танилцуулга\\</h4>\n"
"\\<p>Хэвлэх форматыг серверийн талд Jinja загварчлалын хэлийг ашиглан үүсгэдэг. Бүх маягт нь форматлагдаж буй баримт бичгийн мэдээллийг агуулсан \\<code>doc\\</code> объектод хандах боломжтой. Мөн \\<code>frappe\\</code> модулиар дамжуулан нийтлэг хэрэгслүүдэд хандаж болно.\\</p>\n"
"\\<p>Загварчлалын хувьд Bootstrap CSS framework-ийг ашиглах боломжтой бөгөөд бүх ангиллуудыг бүрэн ашиглаж болно.\\</p>\n"
"\\<hr>\n"
"\\<h4>Лавлагаа\\</h4>\n"
"\\<ol>\n"
"&#x9;\\<li>\\<a href=\"[http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/](http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/)\" target=\"\\_blank\">Jinja загварчлалын хэл\\</a>\\</li>\n"
"&#x9;\\<li>\\<a href=\"[http://getbootstrap.com](http://getbootstrap.com)\" target=\"\\_blank\">Bootstrap CSS framework\\</a>\\</li>\n"
"\\</ol>\n"
"\\<hr>\n"
"\\<h4>Жишээ\\</h4>\n"
"\\<pre>\\<code>&lt;h3&gt;{{ doc.select\\_print\\_heading or \"Нэхэмжлэх\" }}&lt;/h3&gt;\n"
"&lt;div class=\"row\"&gt;\n"
"&#x9;&lt;div class=\"col-md-3 text-right\"&gt;Харилцагчийн нэр&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&#x9;&lt;div class=\"col-md-9\"&gt;{{ doc.customer\\_name }}&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;div class=\"row\"&gt;\n"
"&#x9;&lt;div class=\"col-md-3 text-right\"&gt;Огноо&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&#x9;&lt;div class=\"col-md-9\"&gt;{{ doc.get\\_formatted(\"invoice\\_date\") }}&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;table class=\"table table-bordered\"&gt;\n"
"&#x9;&lt;tbody&gt;\n"
"&#x9;\t&lt;tr&gt;\n"
"&#x9;\t\t&lt;th&gt;№&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"&#x9;\t\t&lt;th&gt;Барааны нэр&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"&#x9;\t\t&lt;th&gt;Тайлбар&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"&#x9;\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Тоо хэмжээ&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"&#x9;\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Үнэ&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"&#x9;\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Дүн&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"&#x9;\t&lt;/tr&gt;\n"
"&#x9;\t{%- for row in doc.items -%}\n"
"&#x9;\t&lt;tr&gt;\n"
"&#x9;\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 3%;\"&gt;{{ row\\.idx }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"&#x9;\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 20%;\"&gt;\n"
"&#x9;\t\t\t{{ row\\.item\\_name }}\n"
"&#x9;\t\t\t{% if row\\.item\\_code != row\\.item\\_name -%}\n"
"&#x9;\t\t\t&lt;br&gt;Барааны код: {{ row\\.item\\_code}}\n"
"&#x9;\t\t\t{%- endif %}\n"
"&#x9;\t\t&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"&#x9;\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 37%;\"&gt;\n"
"&#x9;\t\t\t&lt;div style=\"border: 0px;\"&gt;{{ row\\.description }}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"&#x9;\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{ row\\.qty }} {{ row\\.uom or row\\.stock\\_uom }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"&#x9;\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 15%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{\n"
"&#x9;\t\t\trow\\.get\\_formatted(\"rate\", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"&#x9;\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 15%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{\n"
"&#x9;\t\t\trow\\.get\\_formatted(\"amount\", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"&#x9;\t&lt;/tr&gt;\n"
"&#x9;\t{%- endfor -%}\n"
"&#x9;&lt;/tbody&gt;\n"
"&lt;/table&gt;\\</code>\\</pre>\n"
"\\<hr>\n"
"\\<h4>Түгээмэл функцууд\\</h4>\n"
"\\<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n"
"&#x9;\\<tbody>\n"
"&#x9;\t\\<tr>\n"
"&#x9;\t\t\\<td style=\"width: 30%;\">\\<code>doc.get\\_formatted(\"[fieldname]\", [parent\\_doc])\\</code>\\</td>\n"
"&#x9;\t\t\\<td>Баримт бичгийн утгыг Огноо, Валют зэрэг форматаар авна. Валютын төрлийн талбарт эх \\<code>doc\\</code>-ийг дамжуулна.\\</td>\n"
"&#x9;\t\\</tr>\n"
"&#x9;\t\\<tr>\n"
"&#x9;\t\t\\<td style=\"width: 30%;\">\\<code>frappe.db.get\\_value(\"[doctype]\", \"[name]\", \"fieldname\")\\</code>\\</td>\n"
"&#x9;\t\t\\<td>Өөр баримт бичгээс утга авна.\\</td>\n"
"&#x9;\t\\</tr>\n"
"&#x9;\\</tbody>\n"
"\\</table>\n"

#. Description of the 'Template' (Code) field in DocType 'Address Template'
#: frappe/contacts/doctype/address_template/address_template.json:35
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid "<h4>Default Template</h4>\n"
"<p>Uses <a href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/\">Jinja Templating</a> and all the fields of Address (including Custom Fields if any) will be available</p>\n"
"<pre><code>{{ address_line1 }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if address_line2 %}{{ address_line2 }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{{ city }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if state %}{{ state }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if pincode %} PIN:  {{ pincode }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{{ country }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if phone %}Phone: {{ phone }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if fax %}Fax: {{ fax }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if email_id %}Email: {{ email_id }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"</code></pre>"
msgstr "<h4>Анхдагч загвар</h4>\n"
"<p>Хэрэглээ <a href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/\">Жинжа загварчлал</a> болон хаягийн бүх талбарууд (хэрэв байгаа бол өөрчлөн тохируулсан талбаруудыг оруулаад) боломжтой байх болно</p>\n"
"<pre><code>{{ address_line1 }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if address_line2 %}{{ address_line2 }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{{ city }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if state %}{{ state }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if pincode %} ПИН:  {{ pincode }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{{ country }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if phone %}Утас: {{ phone }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if fax %}Факс: {{ fax }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if email_id %}И-мэйл: {{ email_id }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"</code></pre>"

#. Content of the 'Email Reply Help' (HTML) field in DocType 'Email Template'
#: frappe/email/doctype/email_template/email_template.json:42
msgid "<h4>Email Reply Example</h4>\n\n"
"<pre>Order Overdue\n\n"
"Transaction {{ name }} has exceeded Due Date. Please take necessary action.\n\n"
"Details\n\n"
"- Customer: {{ customer }}\n"
"- Amount: {{ grand_total }}\n"
"</pre>\n\n"
"<h4>How to get fieldnames</h4>\n\n"
"<p>The fieldnames you can use in your email template are the fields in the document from which you are sending the email. You can find out the fields of any documents via Setup &gt; Customize Form View and selecting the document type (e.g. Sales Invoice)</p>\n\n"
"<h4>Templating</h4>\n\n"
"<p>Templates are compiled using the Jinja Templating Language. To learn more about Jinja, <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">read this documentation.</a></p>\n"
msgstr "<h4>И-мэйл хариулах жишээ</h4>\n\n"
"<pre>Захиалгын хугацаа хэтэрсэн\n\n"
"Гүйлгээ {{ name }} хугацаа хэтэрсэн байна. Шаардлагатай арга хэмжээг авна уу.\n\n"
"Дэлгэрэнгүй\n\n"
"- Үйлчлүүлэгч: {{ customer }}\n"
"- Дүн: {{ grand_total }}\n"
"</pre>\n\n"
"<h4>Талбарын нэрийг хэрхэн авах вэ</h4>\n\n"
"<p>Таны имэйл загварт ашиглаж болох талбарын нэрс нь таны баримт бичигт байгаа талбарууд юм. имэйл илгээж байна. Та аливаа баримт бичгийн талбаруудыг &gt; Тохиргоо хийх маягтын харагдац болон баримт бичгийн төрлийг сонгох (жишээ нь Борлуулалтын нэхэмжлэх) хэсгээс олж болно.</p>\n\n"
"<h4>Загвар үүсгэх</h4>\n\n"
"<p>Загваруудыг Jinja Templating Language ашиглан эмхэтгэсэн. Jinja-ийн талаар дэлгэрэнгүй мэдээлэл авахыг хүсвэл <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">энэ баримт бичгийг уншина уу.</a></p>\n"

#. Content of the 'html_5' (HTML) field in DocType 'Data Import'
#: frappe/core/doctype/data_import/data_import.json:147
msgid "<h5 class=\"text-muted uppercase\">Or</h5>"
msgstr "<h5 class=\"text-muted uppercase\">Эсвэл</h5>"

#. Content of the 'Message Examples' (HTML) field in DocType 'Notification'
#: frappe/email/doctype/notification/notification.json:247
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid "<h5>Message Example</h5>\n\n"
"<pre>&lt;h3&gt;Order Overdue&lt;/h3&gt;\n\n"
"&lt;p&gt;Transaction {{ doc.name }} has exceeded Due Date. Please take necessary action.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n"
"&lt;!-- show last comment --&gt;\n"
"{% if comments %}\n"
"Last comment: {{ comments[-1].comment }} by {{ comments[-1].by }}\n"
"{% endif %}\n\n"
"&lt;h4&gt;Details&lt;/h4&gt;\n\n"
"&lt;ul&gt;\n"
"&lt;li&gt;Customer: {{ doc.customer }}\n"
"&lt;li&gt;Amount: {{ doc.grand_total }}\n"
"&lt;/ul&gt;\n"
"</pre>"
msgstr "<h5>Зурвасын жишээ</h5>\n\n"
"<pre>&lt;h3&gt;Захиалгын хугацаа хэтэрсэн&lt;/h3&gt;\n\n"
"&lt;p&gt;Гүйлгээ {{ doc.name }} хугацаа хэтэрсэн байна. Шаардлагатай арга хэмжээг авна уу.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n"
"&lt;!-- сүүлийн сэтгэгдлийг харуулах --&gt;\n"
"{% if comments %}\n"
"Сүүлийн сэтгэгдэл: {{ comments[-1].comment }} зохиогч {{ comments[-1].by }}\n"
"{% endif %}\n\n"
"&lt;h4&gt;Дэлгэрэнгүй мэдээлэл&lt;/h4&gt;\n\n"
"&lt;ul&gt;\n"
"&lt;li&gt;Үйлчлүүлэгч: {{ doc.customer }}\n"
"&lt;li&gt;Дүн: {{ doc.grand_total }}\n"
"&lt;/ul&gt;\n"
"</pre>"

#. Content of the 'html_7' (HTML) field in DocType 'Notification'
#: frappe/email/doctype/notification/notification.json:198
msgid "<p><strong>{{ __(\"Condition Examples\") }}:</strong></p>\n"
"<pre><code class=\"language-python\">doc.status==\"Open\"<br>doc.due_date==nowdate()<br>doc.total &gt; 40000\n"
"</code></pre>\n"
msgstr "<p><strong>{{ __(\"Condition Examples\") }}:</strong></p>\n"
"<pre><code class=\"language-python\">doc.status==\"Нээлттэй\"<br>doc.due_date==nowdate()<br>doc.total &gt; 40000\n"
"</code></pre>\n"

#. Content of the 'html_condition' (HTML) field in DocType 'Webhook'
#: frappe/integrations/doctype/webhook/webhook.json:86
msgid "<p><strong>{{ __(\"Condition Examples\") }}:</strong></p>\n"
"<pre>doc.status==\"Open\"<br>doc.due_date==nowdate()<br>doc.total &gt; 40000\n"
"</pre>"
msgstr "<p><strong>{{ __(\"Condition Examples\") }}:</strong></p>\n"
"<pre>doc.status==\"Нээлттэй\"<br>doc.due_date==nowdate()<br>doc.total &gt; 40000\n"
"</pre>"

#. Content of the 'Condition description' (HTML) field in DocType 'Web Form'
#: frappe/website/doctype/web_form/web_form.json:383
msgid "<p>Multiple webforms can be created for a single doctype. Add filters specific to this webform to display correct record after submission.</p><p>For Example:</p>\n"
"<p>If you create a separate webform every year to capture feedback from employees add a \n"
" field named year in doctype and add a filter <b>year = 2023</b></p>\n"
msgstr "<p>Нэг баримт бичгийн төрөлд зориулж олон вэб маягт үүсгэж болно. Илгээсний дараа зөв бичлэгийг харуулахын тулд энэ вэб маягтад тусгай шүүлтүүр нэмнэ үү.</p><p>Жишээ нь:</p>\n"
"<p>Хэрэв та ажилчдын санал хүсэлтийг авахын тулд жил бүр тусдаа вэб маягт үүсгэдэг бол doctype дотор жил гэсэн нэртэй \n"
" талбарыг нэмж, <b>шүүлтүүр нэмнэ үү. жил = 2023</b></p>\n"

#. Description of the 'Context Script' (Code) field in DocType 'Web Page'
#: frappe/website/doctype/web_page/web_page.json:307
msgid "<p>Set context before rendering a template. Example:</p><p>\n"
"</p><div><pre><code>\n"
"context.project = frappe.get_doc(\"Project\", frappe.form_dict.name)\n"
"</code></pre></div>"
msgstr "<p>Загварыг үзүүлэхээс өмнө контекстийг тохируулна уу. Жишээ:</p><p>\n"
"</p><div><pre><code>\n"
"context.project = frappe.get_doc(\"Төсөл\", frappe.form_dict.name)\n"
"</code></pre></div>"

#. Content of the 'JS Message' (HTML) field in DocType 'Custom HTML Block'
#: frappe/desk/doctype/custom_html_block/custom_html_block.json:72
msgid "<p>To interact with above HTML you will have to use `root_element` as a parent selector.</p><p>For example:</p><pre class=\"p-3 bg-gray-100 border-radius rounded-sm mb-0\" style=\"width: fit-content;\"><code>// here root_element is provided by default\n"
"let some_class_element = root_element.querySelector('.some-class');\n"
"some_class_element.textContent = \"New content\";\n"
"</code></pre>"
msgstr "<p>Дээрх HTML-тэй харилцахын тулд та `root_element`-г эцэг сонгогч болгон ашиглах шаардлагатай болно.</p><p>Жишээ нь:</p><pre class=\"p-3 bg-gray-100 border-radius rounded-sm mb-0\" style=\"width: fit-content;\"><code>// энд root_element нь анхдагчаар өгөгдсөн\n"
"let some_class_element = root_element.querySelector('.some-class');\n"
"some_class_element.textContent = \"Шинэ контент\";\n"
"</code></pre>"

#: frappe/twofactor.py:454
#, python-brace-format
msgid "<p>Your OTP secret on {0} has been reset. If you did not perform this reset and did not request it, please contact your System Administrator immediately.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Таны {0} дээрх OTP нууц үгийг дахин тохируулсан. Хэрэв та энэ дахин тохируулгыг хийгээгүй бөгөөд хүсэлт гаргаагүй бол Системийн админтайгаа нэн даруй холбогдоно уу.</p>"

#. Description of the 'Cron Format' (Data) field in DocType 'Scheduled Job
#. Type'
#. Description of the 'Cron Format' (Data) field in DocType 'Server Script'
#: frappe/core/doctype/scheduled_job_type/scheduled_job_type.json:57
#: frappe/core/doctype/server_script/server_script.json:141
msgid "<pre>*  *  *  *  *\n"
"┬  ┬  ┬  ┬  ┬\n"
"│  │  │  │  │\n"
"│  │  │  │  └ day of week (0 - 6) (0 is Sunday)\n"
"│  │  │  └───── month (1 - 12)\n"
"│  │  └────────── day of month (1 - 31)\n"
"│  └─────────────── hour (0 - 23)\n"
"└──────────────────── minute (0 - 59)\n\n"
"---\n\n"
"* - Any value\n"
"/ - Step values\n"
"</pre>\n"
msgstr "<pre>* * * * *\n"
"┬ ┬ ┬ ┬\n"
"│ │ │ │\n"
"│ │ │ │ └ долоо хоногийн өдөр (0 - 6) (0 нь Ням гараг)\n"
"│ │ │ │ │─── сар (1 - 12)\n"
"│ │ ─────────── сар (1 - 31)\n"
"│ └─────────────── цаг (0 - 23)\n"
"└────────────────── минут (0 - 59)\n\n"
"---\n\n"
"* - Дурын утга\n"
"/ - Алхамын утга\n"
"</pre>\n"

#. Content of the 'Example' (HTML) field in DocType 'Workflow Transition'
#: frappe/workflow/doctype/workflow_transition/workflow_transition.json:88
msgid "<pre><code>doc.grand_total &gt; 0</code></pre>\n\n"
"<p>Conditions should be written in simple Python. Please use properties available in the form only.</p>\n"
"<p>Allowed functions:\n"
"</p><ul>\n"
"<li>frappe.db.get_value</li>\n"
"<li>frappe.db.get_list</li>\n"
"<li>frappe.session</li>\n"
"<li>frappe.utils.now_datetime</li>\n"
"<li>frappe.utils.get_datetime</li>\n"
"<li>frappe.utils.add_to_date</li>\n"
"<li>frappe.utils.now</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>Example: </p><pre><code>doc.creation &gt; frappe.utils.add_to_date(frappe.utils.now_datetime(), days=-5, as_string=True, as_datetime=True) </code></pre><p></p>"
msgstr "\\<pre>\\<code>doc.grand\\_total &gt; 0\\</code>\\</pre>\n\n"
"\\<p>Нөхцөлийг энгийн Python хэлбэрээр бичнэ үү. Зөвхөн маягтад ашиглах боломжтой шинж чанаруудыг ашиглана уу.\\</p>\n"
"\\<p>Зөвшөөрөгдсөн функцууд:\n"
"\\</p>\\<ul>\n"
"\\<li>frappe.db.get\\_value\\</li>\n"
"\\<li>frappe.db.get\\_list\\</li>\n"
"\\<li>frappe.session\\</li>\n"
"\\<li>frappe.utils.now\\_datetime\\</li>\n"
"\\<li>frappe.utils.get\\_datetime\\</li>\n"
"\\<li>frappe.utils.add\\_to\\_date\\</li>\n"
"\\<li>frappe.utils.now\\</li>\n"
"\\</ul>\n"
"\\<p>Жишээ: \\</p>\\<pre>\\<code>doc.creation &gt; frappe.utils.add\\_to\\_date(frappe.utils.now\\_datetime(), days=-5, as\\_string=True, as\\_datetime=True) \\</code>\\</pre>\\<p>\\</p>"

